# Build artifacts and VCS metadata excluded from Docker build contexts.
# Both TroveServer/ and TroveWeb/ images build from the monorepo root as their context.
**/.build
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/coverage-e2e
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/eslint_report.json
**/DerivedData
**/.git
.git
**/.DS_Store
# Local configuration and planning are never part of a publishable build context.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.swiftpm
**/*.xcresult
planning
.local-repositories
TroveServer/Packages
TroveAPI/Packages
Trove.code-workspace
